---------+---------+-----------+----------+---------+---------+--------------+-------------
- a      | integer |           |          |         | plain   |              | 
-Publications:
-    "pub1"
-
-drop publication pub1;
-drop schema alter1 cascade;
-drop schema alter2 cascade;
